      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 1a7ea704d5946a744de92ecca8291ed893008cd6\nparent 54e1a95a12e7d96e1207f9b558a9fc71d774c046\nauthor will <will@256k1.dev> 1784034288 +0100\ncommitter will <will@256k1.dev> 1784036179 +0100\n\nci: move BSD SDK setup out of image build\n\nThe base install script runs while constructing the CI image, but the BSD\nSDKs are only needed later when compiling the source in the running\ncontainer.\n\nMoving them out of base_install.sh means we can cache them similarly to\nother sources/caches.\n",
